{"version":1,"content":"<p>對於城市污染，人類有着豐富的對抗經驗，我們會瘋狂清理河道，限制汽車排放尾氣，把工廠關停，搬遷到更遠的地方。抗爭幾十年，好不容易讓城市體面了不少。如今，所有人卻在一種無孔不入的污染面前，束手無策。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587786.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T03:23:52.364852+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":102,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T03:03:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T03:17:13.071699+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T03:17:13.071699+00:00","content_hash":"019f118bff6cfacfbb373b9c4f61a1ec3e4d5f85f292a96ae93db562ee0d865f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}